<title>TANZANIA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Young Africans (Tanzania) and Express (Uganda) drew 0-0 in their African Champions' League preliminary round match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
